<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="mr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#101827">
<title>RandomCall X</title>

<style>
* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #0b1120;
  color: #f8fafc;
}

header {
  padding: 24px 18px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #172554, #312e81);
  border-radius: 0 0 24px 24px;
}

header h1 {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 27px;
}

header p {
  color: #cbd5e1;
  margin-bottom: 0;
}

main {
  max-width: 650px;
  margin: auto;
  padding: 16px;
}

.balance {
  margin-top: 18px;
  padding: 20px;
  background: #172033;
  border: 1px solid #334155;
  border-radius: 18px;
}

.balance h2 {
  margin: 0 0 8px;
  font-size: 19px;
}

.balance p {
  color: #cbd5e1;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 12px;
  margin: 18px 0;
}

.card {
  background: #172033;
  border: 1px solid #334155;
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 17px 13px;
}

.icon {
  font-size: 27px;
}

.card h3 {
  margin: 12px 0 6px;
  font-size: 16px;
}

.card p {
  margin: 0;
  color: #cbd5e1;
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.section {
  margin-top: 22px;
  padding: 18px;
  background: #172033;
  border: 1px solid #334155;
  border-radius: 18px;
}

h2 {
  font-size: 19px;
}

input, select {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 13px;
  margin: 7px 0;
  background: #0b1120;
  color: white;
  border: 1px solid #475569;
  border-radius: 10px;
  font-size: 16px;
}

button {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 13px;
  margin-top: 9px;
  background: #4f46e5;
  color: white;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 10px;
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: bold;
  cursor: pointer;
}

button.secondary {
  background: #334155;
}

button.call {
  background: #15803d;
}

button:focus-visible,
input:focus-visible,
select:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid #a5b4fc;
  outline-offset: 2px;
}

.entry {
  padding: 12px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #334155;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.entry:last-child {
  border-bottom: none;
}

.small {
  color: #cbd5e1;
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

footer {
  padding: 24px 10px;
  text-align: center;
  color: #94a3b8;
  font-size: 12px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <h1>📞 RandomCall X</h1>
  <p>Business Calling & Customer Manager</p>
</header>

<main>

  <div class="balance">
    <h2>Welcome to RandomCall X</h2>
    <p>तुमच्या बिझनेस कॉल्स आणि ग्राहकांच्या नोंदी एकाच ठिकाणी व्यवस्थापित करा.</p>
    <p>🟢 Prototype Mode — Free</p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">📞</
